<title>PHILIPPINES: Lepanto nine-month net 98.062 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Lepanto nine-month net 98.062 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine gold and copper miner Lepanto Consolidated Mining Co said on Tuesday it posted a net income of 98.062 million pesos for the first nine months of the year.</p>
<p>Lepanto said revenues for the first three quarters of the year amounted to 609.75 million pesos.</p>
